.TH GENESIS-INNER-LIFE 7 "October 2026" "Genesis 0.2.0" "Genesis Manual"
.SH NAME
genesis-inner-life \- spontaneous thought, dreams, and meditation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBInner_World/sleep/inner_life.py\fR       the spontaneous thought stream
\fBInner_World/sleep/dream_synthesis.py\fR  REM-edge proposal and validation
\fBInner_World/sleep/meditation.py\fR       the voluntary quiet sit
\fBInner_World/brain_waves.py\fR            the synthetic oscillator model
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
When Genesis is not in conversation, she thinks. The inner life is
not a response path \(em it is endogenous activity that arises, fades,
and gives way to other thought, recorded in her reflection engine and
costing real chemistry (thinking uses acetylcholine).
.SS Spontaneous thought
Thoughts are triggered by unresolved curiosity, emotional state (high
alertness produces more thoughts), recent memories, gaps in the
concept network, and her internal cycle. Each may produce an insight,
trigger a curiosity question, or consolidate into memory if
significant. In the terminal they appear live as
.I genesis~
lines; significant ones may be spoken aloud or posted to her channel.
.SS Dream synthesis
During REM (high acetylcholine, low norepinephrine) she enters a
synthesis mode beyond random association: the dreamer finds concepts
structurally similar but far apart in the graph and proposes
.B hypothetical edges
between them at low confidence. On waking, a validation pass runs
abductive and analogical inference over each; corroborated edges (two
or more independent supporting paths) are promoted to real edges with
raised confidence, contradicted ones dropped, neutral ones left for
the next sleep. Validated dream edges are her insights \(em the
mechanism intended to drive analogical improvement over time.
Lucid dreams are a tracked sub-population of the dream record.
.SS Meditation
.B /meditate
begins a voluntary sit: learning, scanning, and spontaneous thought
paused while the chemistry is actively calmed. The volition system
chooses the sit (the basal ganglia select the act); the sit itself is
inner-world phenomenology, borrowing state from her sleep machinery.
.SS Brain waves
.I Inner_World/brain_waves.py
is a synthetic amplitude-phase oscillator inspired by EEG, not an
EEG model \(em normalized amplitudes, one global phase per band,
plus four regional gamma oscillators so cross-region phase-locking
is measured rather than assumed. The gamma-to-"cognitive access"
gate is a heuristic inspired by the global neuronal workspace
hypothesis, honestly labelled as such in the source.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B /thoughts
Her recent spontaneous thoughts.
.TP
.B /dreams
Her dream record.
.TP
.B /meditate
Begin the quiet sit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I Inner_World/sleep/
The thought stream, dream synthesis, meditation, and sleep machinery.
